				<title>SCP-4106</title>
				<link>http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-4106</link>
				<description>

&lt;div class=&quot;scp-image-block block-right&quot; style=&quot;width:400px;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/scp-4106/4106breach/medium.jpg&quot; style=&quot;width:400px;&quot; alt=&quot;medium.jpg&quot; class=&quot;image&quot; /&gt;
