34721" alt="hoah2333" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4915183)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/hoah2333" >hoah2333</a></span></p> <hr /> <p><strong>回复：</strong>诸位前辈别硼了，人都被硼傻了，我一会就把这页归档。</p> </blockquote> <div style="display:none"> <p>➡！！！以上是过往留言归档，添加新留言请下翻！！！⬅</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <hr /> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> <div class="no-addendum"> <div class="no-footer"> <div class="center-collapse"> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">留言板</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">欢迎留言</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <blockquote> <p><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/keyest" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=7027379&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609334721" alt="Keyest" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=7027379)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/keyest" >Keyest</a></span>：过往留言已归档，查看回复请见工具盒tab页。这里是留言板！可以用作：闲聊/建议/询问我给出评分的原因等等，我都会回复。此处会不定期清空，所以务必随意<span class="ruby">编辑<span class="rt">瞎 搞</span></span>。当然也欢迎站内私信！</p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&gt;&#32;[[*user&#32;你的ID]]：这是用来复制的留言格式。</span></p> </blockquote> <hr /></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div style="display:none"> <div class="footnotes-footer"> <div class="title">脚注</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-616299-1"><a href="javascript:;" >1</a>. 俗称金枪鱼。</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-616299-2"><a href="javascript:;" >2</a>. 图片来源见此：<a href="https://pixabay.com/zh/photos/tuna-fish-bigeye-tuna-69317/">https://pixabay.com/zh/photos/tuna-fish-bigeye-tuna-69317/</a> 。使用pixabay授权协议。</div> </div> </div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/keyest" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=7027379&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609334721" alt="Keyest" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=7027379)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/keyest" >Keyest</a></span></p> 
