&lt;em&gt;人需要规则，正如你不能把手雷往自己菊花里塞一样。&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/if-thanos-in-scpu&quot;&gt;If Thanos Strayed In SCP Universe&lt;/a&gt; * &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/simon-arran&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4354147&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1609334724&quot; alt=&quot;Simon Arran&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4354147)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/simon-arran&quot;  &gt;Simon Arran&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;em&gt;如果灭霸在&amp;#8230;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/cngec-ball-art&quot;&gt;艺术作品 GEC球&lt;/a&gt; * &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drmarleak&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4704446&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1609334724&quot; alt=&quot;DrMarleak&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4704446)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drmarleak&quot;  &gt;DrMarleak&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;em&gt;快点进去看看吧！&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
